  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1156/586/create_stuff_title_final-png.png\" width=\"1673\" height=\"592\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@FurtiTwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/985/youtube-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/k3fGJwJqzu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/987/discord-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffurtitwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/988/donate-png.png\" width=\"22%\" height=\"22%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/furti_two/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/986/curseforge-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252ffurti-two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/984/modrinth-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">Create Stuff 'N Additions 是一個運用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 資源，提供全新裝備、工具和小工具的模組！這些裝備不僅能提升你的身體能力（例如力量或挖掘速度），還能賦予你新的移動方式，像是漂浮、彈跳，甚至飛行！根據裝備的類型（黃銅、安山岩或銅），你需要不同的燃料，例如蒸汽（使用水和燃料）、熱能（使用燃料）或液壓能（使用水）！本模組還新增了許多配方，讓某些 Minecraft 物品（如鎖鏈盔甲、珊瑚、地獄石、哭泣的黑曜石和岩漿球...）能夠透過 Create 新增的方式（例如「鬧鬼」和「填充」）來製作。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>&nbsp;最初，這個模組是為了一個名為「Mechanical Life」的法國 Minecraft 伺服器所創建的。</strong> 本模組使用 Hybrid Mcreator 製作。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ueNNUy6enNE?si=wx5D5bbB-RDCxuIL\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LAP-V3GiwYM?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pKb8vEXkRW8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>預計新增功能&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>- 手動無人機（安山岩無人機）</p>\n<p>- 可程式化無人機（黃銅無人機）</p>\n<p>- 載具創意標籤頁</p>\n<p>- 潛水艇</p>\n<p>- 輕型機車&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- 設定檔</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>你可以將 Create Stuff Additions 放入你的整合包中。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>舊版描述（v2.0.0 之前）：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>⛽為你的物品充能：將物品放在副手（例如，選中物品後按 F），然後將燃料（如煤炭、木材...）放在主手，按下 Q 丟出即可</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>新工具：</strong></p>\n<p><br>噴嘴風扇（推動周圍實體，可偏轉箭矢）、烈焰噴射器（噴射火焰）、黃銅攜帶式鑽頭（多功能工具，挖掘速度極快但無法附魔）和鉤爪打蛋器（僅限 1.18.2）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/762198215264305182/890573227523448903/V5ZLu01wLXAtcC1wLXAtcC1wLXAtcC1wLXAtcC1wLXAtcC1wLXAtcCn9cCZhD6gpif1wmuZtcC1wLXAtcC1wLXAtcC1wLXAtcC1w.png?ex=6a4262f3&amp;is=6a411173&amp;hm=fd7d37b61635e8203e972a343a0db531b4217174dc9fa8dfef9f06ad72b38874&amp;\" width=\"1357\" height=\"483\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pvgL6kiceII?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><br><strong>舊版/新版的 Create 工具：</strong></p>\n<p><br>銅工具、鋅工具和黃銅工具<br>烈焰工具：會融化我們挖掘的方塊（石頭：石磚、花崗岩：輝長岩、原木：木炭...），並且攻擊生物時會使其燃燒。（需要用混合機製作）<br>鍍金石英工具：比鑽石更有效率，攻擊力較弱但攻擊速度極快。（需要用機械合成器製作）<br>暗影鋼鐵工具（1.18.2 版本的經驗工具）：採礦等級與鐵相同，但挖掘速度比金還快。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1761/633/image_2026-06-28_190603107-png.png\" width=\"1037\" height=\"362\"><br><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>黃銅噴射背包與黃銅外骨骼：<br></strong></span><br>噴射背包可以讓你飛行。黃銅外骨骼是一件能提供力量或加速效果的護甲。（需要用機械合成器製作）<br>它們使用燃料（要補充燃料，將燃料放在副手，然後丟棄像是木炭、烈焰棒或木材等燃料）<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1761/634/image_2026-06-28_190613334-png.png\" width=\"2334\" height=\"1700\"><br><br></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">銅、鋅、黃銅護甲與黃銅輕型機車：</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1761/635/image_2026-06-28_190631737-png.png\" width=\"2040\" height=\"966\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>其他物品：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1761/636/image_2026-06-28_190648706-png.png\" width=\"1153\" height=\"336\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">你也可以參考我的其他模組：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useless-sword\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/416/64/64/637746702745178325.png\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/items-to-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1070/646/64/64/638606054091700999.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stalwart-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/531/588/64/64/637853847063684188.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seeds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/657/638184557398425576.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/organics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/413/64/64/637746699816017646.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slimy-stuff\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1076/873/64/64/638614825744489631.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/724/578/64/64/638077506455486007.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frosted-friends\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/411/64/64/637746696852738455.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wandering-bags\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/689/759/64/64/638069994452394564.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves-torpedoes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/973/674/64/64/638476410476119618.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/depth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/720/638184653709126308.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/call-of-yucutan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1002/886/64/64/638523299285638581.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enders-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/779/326/64/64/638124003553252444.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sons-of-sins\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1052/109/sons_of_sins_logo_bis.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-confectionery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/531/246/64/64/637852985411120756.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/608/519/64/64/637987931627550518.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-logistics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1116/69/64/64/638670333200272317.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armor-weight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/734/378/64/64/638084439152506136.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamo\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/973/774/64/64/638476553282271633.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ninjaxxs-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/549/392/64/64/637886561525247638.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fuzes-relics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/580/980/64/64/637945482784615684.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
